---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
import Hero from '../components/Hero.astro';
import Cta from '../components/Cta.astro';
---
<Base title={"For Receivers"} description={"Valley Capital Partners buys hotels out of receivership and purchases hotel loans with a receivership in place."}>
<Hero eyebrow={"For receivers and counsel"} title={"A buyer for hotels in receivership."} lead={"We purchase hotels through court-approved receiver sales, and we buy the underlying loan when the lender prefers to sell the note."}>
  <a class="btn btn-light arrow" href="/contact/">Discuss a receivership</a>
</Hero>
<main id="main">
<section class="section"><div class="wrap intro">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">Buying from a receiver</p><h2>We bid in a form a court can approve.</h2>
    <div class="body"><p>A receiver needs a buyer who understands that the sale is the court's to approve, that the property is sold as it stands, and that the hotel has to keep operating until the day it transfers.</p></div></div>
  <dl class="pillars">
    <div><dt>Subject to court approval</dt><dd>Our purchase agreements are written for a sale order, with the receiver's customary limits on representations.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Opening bidder</dt><dd>We will serve as the initial bidder under court-approved overbid procedures.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Deposit on signing</dt><dd>We post a deposit when the agreement is signed.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>As-is</dt><dd>We complete our diligence before we sign and take the hotel in its present condition.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div></section>

<section class="section alt"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">Transition</p><h2>What we handle so the hotel does not miss a night.</h2></div>
  <div class="cells">
    <div><h3>Franchise</h3><p>We apply to the brand for a new franchise agreement in advance of closing and address its improvement requirements directly.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Management</h3><p>We coordinate with the receiver's management company on staff, systems, and the handover of accounts.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Licences</h3><p>We arrange the transfer of the liquor licence and operating permits, with interim arrangements where the state allows.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Bookings</h3><p>Group contracts and advance deposits are identified and honoured through the transfer.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Employees</h3><p>We work with the manager so the staff the hotel depends on stay in place.</p></div>
    <div><h3>Taxes</h3><p>Occupancy and sales tax balances are settled at closing under the sale order.</p></div>
  </div>
</div></section>

<section class="section"><div class="wrap intro">
  <div><p class="eyebrow">For lender's counsel</p><h2>When the lender would prefer to sell the loan.</h2>
    <div class="body"><p>A receivership can run for a long time before a sale closes. Some lenders decide partway through that they would prefer to be paid now.</p>
    <p>We purchase the note with the receivership in place, substitute in as plaintiff, and work with the receiver through to a sale.</p></div></div>
  <dl class="pillars">
    <div><dt>No interruption</dt><dd>The receiver and manager remain in place under the existing order.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>One closing</dt><dd>The lender is paid at the loan sale and has no further role in the case.</dd></div>
    <div><dt>Advances addressed</dt><dd>Protective advances and receivership costs to date are accounted for in the price.</dd></div>
  </dl>
</div></section>

<section class="section alt"><div class="wrap">
  <div class="head"><p class="eyebrow">What we ask for</p><h2>Information that lets us respond.</h2></div>
  <div class="cells two">
    <div><h3>The case</h3><ul><li>Order of appointment</li><li>Receiver's reports to the court</li><li>Any sale procedures already approved</li><li>Status of the foreclosure action</li></ul></div>
    <div><h3>The hotel</h3><ul><li>Operating statements under the receiver</li><li>Monthly performance reports</li><li>Correspondence with the brand</li><li>List of capital needs</li></ul></div>
  </div>
</div></section>
</main>
<Cta title={"Tell us about the hotel and the case."} text={"We respond to receivers and counsel directly."} label={"Discuss a receivership"} />
</Base>
